content.text:
Blocked by a hook: the repo is on `master` and edits need `CLAUDE_ALLOW_MAIN_EDIT=1`, which I can't set on my own process.

The change is ready — 7 lines in `hyprland.nix:119`:

```nix
{
  # Desk 32" 4K. Matched by description, not DP-N: the connector number
  # moves around depending on which dock port it lands on.
  output = "desc:Dell Inc. DELL U3225QE";
  mode = "preferred";
  position = "auto-left";
  scale = 1;
}
```

**What I found:** eDP-1 is at `0x0`, DP-7 (Dell U3225QE, 3840x2160) at `2560x0` — i.e. right. Kanshi is running but has no profile matching this Dell, so Hyprland's catch-all `position = "auto"` is what's placing it. Fixing it in `hyprland.nix` is the right layer.

